{"call_id": "9ba3361e1f3542edad1a6716edf7c29a", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/quickcheck/runs/fad/bookreview/query1/quick-01/results/9ba3361e1f3542edad1a6716edf7c29a.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"submitted\": true, \"answer\": \"The 2020s (books published 2020-2023) have the highest average rating among decades with at least 10 distinct rated books.\\n\\nMethod: Extracted each book's publication year from books_info.details, mapped review.purchase_id to books_info.book_id, grouped ratings by publication decade, and required >= 10 distinct rated books per decade.\\n\\nDecade results (distinct rated books, average rating across all reviews):\\n- 1980s: 11 books, avg 4.21\\n- 1990s: 17 books, avg 3.84\\n- 2000s: 46 books, avg 4.27\\n- 2010s: 88 books, avg 4.61\\n- 2020s: 21 books, avg 4.66  <- highest\\n\\n(Decades 1880s, 1930s, 1940s, 1970s were excluded because they have fewer than 10 distinct rated books.)\\n\\nAnswer: 2020s\\n\"}", "truncated": false}
